# Card art (assets/cards/) is COMMITTED for private, non-distributed use so EAS
# cloud builds include it. This repo has no remote; if you ever add one, keep it
# PRIVATE — these are CDPR card faces. Drop images in assets/cards/, then run
# `npm run optimize:art` and `npm run gen:art`.

